==Overview & Obtainment==
The Saber Mutant Toilet is an [[Exclusive]] [[Units|Unit]] that was added in the [[Episode 77 Part 2 Update]].

It could've been obtained from the [[Shop]] for 199 Robux. you can also get it by [[Trading]], buying from the [[Marketplace]], or being gifted it in the [[Post Office]].
==Appearance==
He wears a helmet, has a jetpack in the back, its arm replaced with a buzzsaw with a laser, has a sword with him all the time, a very armored toilet body, headphones, and a black suit.

