At max level, damage breakdown can be observed as 4k per tick (every .2 seconds) as the damage from the laser attack (does not have piercing), 50k per second from the sword attack (has piercing, slow, and burns for 10k per second afterwards for 10 seconds).

==Strategies== 

*Burn damage has been proven to stack on the same target, resulting in up to an additional 100k damage per second after 10 sword attacks on the same target.
*Try to optimize space as possible, so that when placing boosters, there is way more space for to place more.
*If not upgraded, set target to last to optimize Piercing damage.
*Try to use support units such as [[Leprechaun Cameraman]] to use as a external stun-bait, but also as a booster unit, [[Mewing TV Man]], to stun units by 5 seconds, any time-stop unit (e.g.: [[Future Large Clockman]]).
*This unit can solo the Halloween 2024 Map, so you can by this unit to beat it in 17 minutes!
*With [[Astro Upgraded Titan Cameraman]] (place 1 for slowing), Mewing TV Man (place 1 or 2 for stunning toilets), and Leprechaun Cameraman (booster unit + stunbait), and [[Santa TV Man]], and proper usage of these units with Saber Mutant Toilet being the main DPS unit, you can get to wave 100+ in [[Endless Mode]] in just around 30 minutes (full auto-skip), which is probably perfect for XP grinders.
*
